WEBVTT

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:31.255
And then we did
an amazing thing for preachers.

00:10:31.255 --> 00:10:35.352
We decided to listen and not preach.

00:10:35.352 --> 00:10:37.223
Come on, give it up for me.

00:10:37.223 --> 00:10:40.682
(Laughter) (Applause)

00:10:40.682 --> 00:10:44.792
All right, come on, you're cutting
into my time now, okay? (Laughter)

00:10:44.792 --> 00:10:46.612
But it was amazing.

00:10:46.612 --> 00:10:52.919
We said to them, "We don't know
our own communities after 9 p.m. at night,

00:10:52.919 --> 00:10:55.759
between 9 p.m. and 5 a.m.,

00:10:55.759 --> 00:10:56.809
but you do.

00:10:57.389 --> 00:11:02.551
You are the subject matter experts,
if you will, of that period of time.